"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[10130],{10130:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n# How to take a screen capture in AOSP\\nAOSP 환경에서 ```screencap``` 툴을 이용하여 screen capture 가능합니다.\\n```sh\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"Use screencap\\"\\n}\\n---\\n$ adb exec-out screencap -p > capture.png\\n```\\npng, jpeg, jpg format을 지원하며, filename의 확장자명을 통해 구별합니다.\\n```c\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"frameworks/base/cmds/screencap/screencap.cpp\\"\\n}\\n---\\n...\\n    if (argc == 1) {\\n        std::string_view filename = {argv[0]};\\n        if (filename.ends_with(\\".png\\")) {\\n            baseName = filename.substr(0, filename.size() - 4);\\n            suffix = \\".png\\";\\n            png = true;\\n        } else if (filename.ends_with(\\".jpeg\\")) {\\n            baseName = filename.substr(0, filename.size() - 5);\\n            suffix = \\".jpeg\\";\\n            jpeg = true;\\n        } else if (filename.ends_with(\\".jpg\\")) {\\n            baseName = filename.substr(0, filename.size() - 4);\\n            suffix = \\".jpg\\";\\n            jpeg = true;\\n        } else {\\n            baseName = filename;\\n        }\\n    }\\n...\\n```\\ndisplay ID를 이용하면 다른 display 화면도 capture 가능합니다.\\n연결되어 있는 display ID는 <mark>dumpsys</mark>로 확인 가능합니다.\\n```sh\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"Use screencap in other display\\"\\n}\\n---\\n$ adb shell dumpsys SurfaceFlinger --display-id\\nDisplay 0 (HWC display 1): no identification data\\n  \\n$ adb exec-out screencap -d 0 -p > capture.png\\n```"}')}}]);